1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:40,230 --> 00:01:42,460
I heard lately

10
00:01:42,510 --> 00:01:45,490
you've been making foes everywhere.

11
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:49,020
Even your fellow disciples are baffled.

12
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:51,690
So the rumors are true.

13
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,490
Beneath the Eye of the Sea,

14
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,210
what beast is sealed?

15
00:01:59,510 --> 00:02:01,130
Beast? There is none.

16
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,130
Didn't you hear

17
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,210
the roars just now?

18
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,460
Heard nothing.

19
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,180
All six realms

20
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,660
are full of fools.

21
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:12,500
Pregenesis Sword.

22
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:13,610
What did you say?

23
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:16,060
Back then, the Grand Mage of Voidcity

24
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,890
set up this Sea-Calming Pillar

25
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:19,610
to suppress the East Sea's Eye.

26
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,690
The Grand Mage's magical power

27
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:25,610
is beyond even yours.

28
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,940
So you can't break this seal

29
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,100
or take the Sea-Calming Pillar.

30
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:32,500
But the Pregenesis Sword can.

31
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,290
Exactly.

32
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,690
The Pregenesis Sword

33
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:37,890
is sole magic instrument to break it.

34
00:02:37,910 --> 00:02:38,610
Where is it?

35
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:40,380
Bear Stockade, South Sea.

36
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:43,890
Yunxiao.

37
00:02:44,430 --> 00:02:47,010
Turn back before it's too late.

38
00:02:47,630 --> 00:02:48,890
If not for yourself,

39
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,450
do it for your sect

40
00:02:50,470 --> 00:02:51,540
and all living souls.

41
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,980
Don't lecture me.

42
00:02:53,710 --> 00:02:54,500
You're not worthy.

43
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:57,260
Just a pillar.

44
00:02:58,310 --> 00:02:59,980
I will pull it out.

45
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,260
Soldiers are here.

46
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:35,570
Who's making the fuss?

47
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,290
Quite a crowd.

48
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,730
A thousand years have passed.

49
00:03:58,870 --> 00:04:01,260
You still won't settle down.

50
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:09,500
[Episode 9]

51
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:12,170
Surround the demon. Don't let her go.

52
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,290
Kneel.

53
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,410
That brat?

54
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,860
He dared to scheme against me.

55
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,100
Made it in time.

56
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,810
You brat, I saved you

57
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,370
and you send men to catch me?

58
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,170
You misunderstood me.

59
00:05:00,270 --> 00:05:01,580
I was trying to save you.

60
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,490
Save me?

61
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:06,020
Yunxiao, no matter who lured you

62
00:05:06,070 --> 00:05:08,100
to the Sea-Calming Pillar,

63
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,220
it's all a trap.

64
00:05:09,310 --> 00:05:10,290
Even if you succeeded,

65
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:11,700
you'll suffer backlash.

66
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:13,980
I said, I don't care.

67
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,930
But Trifairy Isle folks care.

68
00:05:15,950 --> 00:05:17,490
Think of them.

69
00:05:17,510 --> 00:05:18,980
How do you know about Trifairy Isle?

70
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,290
Alright, you're here now.

71
00:05:24,310 --> 00:05:25,490
Speak your mind.

72
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:31,290
Fairy Yunxiao is not heartless.

73
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:34,900
Everything she did

74
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,660
was beyond her control.

75
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,290
A person,

76
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:41,900
if forced against their will,

77
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:44,980
must have someone they love.

78
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:48,410
And loved ones

79
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,370
are Moon Elder's specialty.

80
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:53,050
So, please find us

81
00:05:53,070 --> 00:05:55,250
who Yunxiao cares about.

82
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:56,170
He...

83
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:57,370
Could he?

84
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,220
He's Moon Elder.

85
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,930
He only handles marriages.

86
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,490
Only ties red strings.

87
00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:03,370
He can't handle this.

88
00:06:03,390 --> 00:06:04,660
Not so.

89
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:08,900
Eastwood Duke,
family bonds are fate too.

90
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:11,050
Red strings are for marriage

91
00:06:11,310 --> 00:06:13,980
but I don't just have red ones.

92
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:14,900
I got

93
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,140
black, white, green, blue, orange,

94
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:22,140
patterned, yellow, yours, mine, his,

95
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:24,050
big, small, thick, thin...

96
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:25,660
Fine.

97
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,930
Checking for you.

98
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:29,730
I...

99
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,020
Yunxiao, just think.

100
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,250
If you perish in the East Sea,

101
00:06:34,270 --> 00:06:35,980
what about Trifairy Isle?

102
00:06:36,070 --> 00:06:37,220
They'd be heartbroken.

103
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:40,250
But if I don't do this,

104
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,100
do you know what I'll lose?

105
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:45,610
Yunxiao, taking by force

106
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,100
isn't the best way.

107
00:06:47,430 --> 00:06:48,610
You're brilliant.

108
00:06:48,630 --> 00:06:49,900
You should understand.

109
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,410
Pearl Elites, form up.

110
00:06:57,630 --> 00:06:58,900
Nothing to do with me.

111
00:07:02,270 --> 00:07:04,700
You stormed in and burned Lotus Hall.

112
00:07:04,830 --> 00:07:05,810
You must be punished.

113
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,700
What punishment do I deserve?

114
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:11,020
You demon. Think we stand unguarded?

115
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,850
Yunxiao, do not be rash.

116
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,900
Si'er.

117
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:20,370
Demon, stop!

118
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,290
Don't hurt her.

119
00:07:21,870 --> 00:07:22,700
Don't hurt her.

120
00:07:25,190 --> 00:07:26,580
Speak. Speak.

121
00:07:27,310 --> 00:07:28,780
Your Highness, now.

122
00:07:31,260 --> 00:07:36,140
[Token]

123
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:49,290
Yunxiao.

124
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,900
Survive. Don't let them use you.

125
00:07:58,270 --> 00:07:59,050
Si'er.

126
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,580
The First Prince beat the Demon.

127
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,700
The First Prince beat the Demon.

128
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,100
The First Prince is a hero.

129
00:08:21,310 --> 00:08:22,610
The First Prince is a hero.

130
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,250
The First Prince is a hero.

131
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:25,580
The First Prince is mighty.

132
00:08:26,870 --> 00:08:28,460
The First Prince beat the Demon.

133
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:35,100
Was all this Your Majesty's plan?

134
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:40,060
Truly brilliant and farsighted.

135
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,770
Stopped a war before it started.

136
00:08:43,910 --> 00:08:46,300
Even if I train another thousand years,

137
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:48,610
I couldn't match a hair on your head.

138
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,890
Even with ten thousand more years,

139
00:08:49,910 --> 00:08:52,490
couldn't match a single scale.

140
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:57,100
I didn't plan a thing.

141
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,300
Well...

142
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:02,340
Your Majesty is blessed by fate.

143
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:03,890
Any disaster before you

144
00:09:03,910 --> 00:09:05,490
turns into good luck.

145
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,100
Just one thing.

146
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:09,490
Why tell Fairy Yunxiao

147
00:09:09,510 --> 00:09:11,250
about the Pregenesis Sword?

148
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:17,490
A feud is best settled than deepened.

149
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,300
Let her be.

150
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:21,180
To end things this way,

151
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,180
it is just perfect.

152
00:09:25,390 --> 00:09:26,890
But what a pity.

153
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:27,940
A pity for what?

154
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,100
A fair maiden, of course.

155
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,130
A fair maiden?

156
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:35,100
She's the first blush of cloud
at the Dawn of Creation.

157
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:38,850
Heavenreach Master's top disciple.

158
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,490
The youngest Quasi-Saint
in the Three Realms.

159
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,700
With her talent and fortune,

160
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:46,300
if she stayed the path,

161
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:50,010
she'd live forever, revered by all.

162
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:53,460
But darkness possessed her,

163
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:56,300
making her ruthless and fall from grace.

164
00:09:57,480 --> 00:10:00,250
Such a tragic waste.

165
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:12,820
Yunxiao.

166
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,060
Yunxiao.

167
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:18,340
Yunxiao.

168
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:20,460
You finally answered.

169
00:10:20,870 --> 00:10:21,650
Where'd you go?

170
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,420
Scratched, bumped, hurt?

171
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,300
Anyone else hurt?

172
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,220
Brother,

173
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:27,010
stop nagging.

174
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:29,130
I just felt like

175
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,650
causing a little chaos.

176
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,980
Chaos again?

177
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,300
You and your chaos.

178
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,890
Next time, bring me along.

179
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,300
We'll make it bigger.

180
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,490
Remember.

181
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:41,180
Never cause chaos alone.

182
00:10:41,910 --> 00:10:43,980
Two is better.

183
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,650
If that's not enough,

184
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,850
our sect has tons. Call more backup.

185
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:48,530
No.

186
00:10:48,670 --> 00:10:50,850
This isn't about you, Bixiao, Qiongxiao,

187
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,650
or our sect.

188
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,010
I must do it alone.

189
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:56,650
Why so serious for a little chaos?

190
00:10:58,030 --> 00:10:58,820
You lost weight.

191
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,580
Dark circles too.

192
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:01,650
Not eating well?

193
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:03,100
Brother? Brother?

194
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,980
I'm right here.

195
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:05,180
Can't you see me?

196
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:05,770
Brother?

197
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:06,490
You just touched me.

198
00:11:06,510 --> 00:11:07,220
Brother?

199
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,220
Don't pull that with me.

200
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,340
The spiritual energy here is thin.

201
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,100
- You know?
- Stop it.

202
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,100
Wait. What?

203
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,530
Mine's full, alright?

204
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:15,940
I can't hear you.

205
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:16,770
Don't press that.

206
00:11:30,030 --> 00:11:32,770
No wonder that brat tracked me.

207
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,700
You brat!

208
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:44,580
Brat!

209
00:11:45,670 --> 00:11:47,100
The First Prince is a hero.

210
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,820
The First Prince is a hero.

211
00:11:49,790 --> 00:11:51,820
The First Prince is a hero. So mighty.

212
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,940
I'll sleep and claim credit
at the Celestial Court.

213
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,490
Might solve my problems
once and for all.

214
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:00,770
Li Changshou.

215
00:12:01,390 --> 00:12:02,490
Li Changshou, open up.

216
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:05,650
Open up, Li Changshou.

217
00:12:12,790 --> 00:12:14,850
Weird. Why can't I break 'em down?

218
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:25,650
Other doors are like paper.

219
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:27,580
Why are yours so sturdy?

220
00:12:29,030 --> 00:12:31,130
General Yecha, what brings you here

221
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,300
so late?

222
00:12:32,510 --> 00:12:34,060
Still playing dumb?

223
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,890
You know what you did.

224
00:12:39,030 --> 00:12:40,300
What did I do?

225
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:41,850
Let's have a drink.

226
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:43,220
Didn't we agree?

227
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:45,220
You help me deal with Fairy Yunxiao,

228
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,890
and I'll treat you to a drink.

229
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,010
General, that was just a joke.

230
00:12:52,030 --> 00:12:53,300
Why take it seriously?

231
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:54,890
I'm a bit tired, actually.

232
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:55,940
I just want to sleep.

233
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,700
No way.

234
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,700
I don't owe debts.

235
00:12:59,120 --> 00:12:59,940
Like it or not,

236
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:02,300
you're drinking with me.

237
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:04,220
General, I'd like to sleep.

238
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:10,300
Here.

239
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,180
I'll go first.

240
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:21,250
You can hold your liquor.

241
00:13:21,630 --> 00:13:24,220
Matched me without flinching.

242
00:13:25,510 --> 00:13:28,100
Booze tastes all the same.

243
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:28,980
Awful.

244
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,890
Then why drink so much?

245
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,100
To keep you company.

246
00:13:34,510 --> 00:13:35,610
Besides,

247
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:37,940
it's natural rough guys drink.

248
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,610
I look so vicious for nothing?

249
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:41,940
If the fish and shrimp saw

250
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,060
I don't touch booze,

251
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,580
they'd laugh at me.

252
00:13:45,390 --> 00:13:46,940
Over time,

253
00:13:47,790 --> 00:13:48,820
I got used to it.

254
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:51,370
Just plug my nose and chug.

255
00:13:53,910 --> 00:13:54,820
That's true.

256
00:13:55,870 --> 00:13:58,820
The charm lies in its harshness.

257
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,250
Sorting out everything in life

258
00:14:02,910 --> 00:14:04,250
isn't any fun anyway.

259
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,300
Well said.

260
00:14:10,390 --> 00:14:13,770
You look so frail,

261
00:14:14,030 --> 00:14:15,890
but you always drop

262
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,700
interesting weird wisdom.

263
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:21,180
If all humans were like you,

264
00:14:21,510 --> 00:14:22,650
we wouldn't

265
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:24,770
need to fight, right?

266
00:14:25,790 --> 00:14:28,490
The feud started in ancient times.

267
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:30,300
Settling it now

268
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:32,060
makes everyone miserable.

269
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,890
Dragon King thinks so too, right?

270
00:14:38,670 --> 00:14:41,250
How do you know His Majesty's mind?

271
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:44,250
Why else would he invite

272
00:14:44,270 --> 00:14:46,490
Ascendance Sect to make peace?

273
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,490
And let the First Prince
who hates humans most

274
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:50,980
lead this peace process?

275
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:53,010
Isn't it to make him understand

276
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:55,250
that human-dragon peace was hard-won?

277
00:14:58,270 --> 00:14:59,300
Impressive.

278
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,610
I'll be honest with you.

279
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,300
Originally, the First Prince

280
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,010
didn't plan on letting you go back.

281
00:15:08,270 --> 00:15:09,650
But this time,

282
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:12,820
you've done great work here.

283
00:15:13,670 --> 00:15:15,060
The First Prince agreed

284
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:17,850
to send you off tomorrow morning.

285
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,420
The items in Lotus Hall,

286
00:15:20,790 --> 00:15:21,770
if any catch your eye,

287
00:15:22,550 --> 00:15:23,420
take your pick.

288
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,010
General Yecha.

289
00:15:27,910 --> 00:15:30,100
Are you this honest with everyone?

290
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:37,060
What? Not used to it?

291
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:38,300
Not that.

292
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:41,490
Aren't you scared leaking secrets

293
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,460
will get your butt kicked by the Prince?

294
00:15:45,630 --> 00:15:46,820
You know that too?

295
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:52,490
My biggest dream in life

296
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:55,300
is to take a few blades for him.

297
00:15:56,670 --> 00:15:59,460
Even if I die, worth it.

298
00:15:59,510 --> 00:16:01,220
What's a few kicks to the butt?

299
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:07,420
Such a humble dream.

300
00:16:10,630 --> 00:16:13,770
Truth is, I do have a dream.

301
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:14,980
Let's hear it.

302
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:18,220
I want a name.

303
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:20,890
A name?

304
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:24,100
Us river spirits

305
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,700
have no names.

306
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:27,130
Born shrimp, you're a shrimp soldier.

307
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,770
And crab, a crab general.

308
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:32,490
"Yecha" is just a general label.

309
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:42,700
What about you? Your dream?

310
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:45,220
My dream?

311
00:16:47,390 --> 00:16:48,700
My dream

312
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,460
is to live.

313
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,220
You dying or something?

314
00:16:58,320 --> 00:17:01,010
I mean living safe and sound.

315
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:02,100
Surviving.

316
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:04,460
Seeking immortality, pursuing the Way,

317
00:17:04,510 --> 00:17:06,900
and seeing all the world's beauty.

318
00:17:09,110 --> 00:17:11,250
Beats me. I don't get it.

319
00:17:12,110 --> 00:17:14,290
Anyway, I think you can do it now.

320
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:17,180
Buddy, stop hesitating.

321
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:19,570
Wait too long, the flavor's gone.

322
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,380
Your Yecha tribe lives long.

323
00:17:39,790 --> 00:17:41,660
How can you know

324
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:43,660
how us fleeting humans feel?

325
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:46,490
Just struggling against fate

326
00:17:46,510 --> 00:17:47,490
without drowning

327
00:17:47,510 --> 00:17:49,460
takes all our strength.

328
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:52,700
If I stopped

329
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,490
to enjoy the scenery

330
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:55,570
along the way,

331
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,570
that'd be way too luxurious.

332
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:10,090
This Yecha

333
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:13,700
looks fierce

334
00:18:14,830 --> 00:18:16,050
but has a good heart.

335
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:19,860
If you ever visit Ascendance Sect,

336
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,700
I'll buy you good booze.

337
00:18:26,830 --> 00:18:27,620
Cheers.

338
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,900
So awful.

339
00:18:58,440 --> 00:19:00,530
Well, after that drink,

340
00:19:00,550 --> 00:19:02,460
I woke up feeling terrible.

341
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:05,010
Please check me out.

342
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:08,700
General, stay calm. Just upset stomach.

343
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,090
Upset stomach?

344
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:14,290
General, exhaustion and heavy booze

345
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:16,980
set your system on fire,
making you hurl and purge.

346
00:19:17,310 --> 00:19:20,050
It's not fatal, but still be careful.

347
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:21,860
Okay. Got it.

348
00:19:27,270 --> 00:19:28,460
That is why I always say,

349
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,050
you're not a physician,

350
00:19:30,070 --> 00:19:32,490
but a merciful immortal.

351
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:35,490
Sir, would you name me?

352
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:37,570
Don't like being called Yecha?

353
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:39,090
In my teachings,

354
00:19:39,310 --> 00:19:42,220
the Yecha clan are noble guardians.

355
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,570
Grand and majestic.

356
00:19:44,310 --> 00:19:46,490
Perfect for a Royal Guard.

357
00:19:47,110 --> 00:19:48,900
Those teachings of yours...

358
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:50,660
Where did they come from?

359
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:52,700
Every time I ask, you never tell.

360
00:19:53,030 --> 00:19:55,460
When His Highness takes the tallies

361
00:19:55,590 --> 00:19:57,010
and resumes troop reviews

362
00:19:57,110 --> 00:19:59,290
to discuss declaring war on humans,

363
00:20:00,070 --> 00:20:02,810
I'll tell you then.

364
00:20:04,030 --> 00:20:05,380
That day will never come.

365
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,050
How so?

366
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,980
They just don't want to fight.

367
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,570
Honestly, humans aren't as arrogant

368
00:20:16,590 --> 00:20:17,460
as rumors say.

369
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:19,090
Everyone living in peace,

370
00:20:19,110 --> 00:20:20,620
isn't that good?

371
00:20:20,790 --> 00:20:22,660
Plus, I can tell

372
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,570
His Highness feels the same.

373
00:20:24,790 --> 00:20:27,290
Just hasn't confirmed it yet.

374
00:20:27,790 --> 00:20:30,700
Didn't you say peace comes first?

375
00:20:34,310 --> 00:20:35,530
Hearing these words

376
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:38,180
from a vanguard against humans

377
00:20:38,550 --> 00:20:42,010
pleasantly surprises me.

378
00:20:42,270 --> 00:20:42,770
Yes.

379
00:20:44,070 --> 00:20:47,380
I heard it was your plan

380
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,900
to drive Yunxiao out.

381
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,380
You heard too?

382
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,700
Don't let my big size fool you.

383
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:56,860
I drop good tactics sometimes.

384
00:20:58,720 --> 00:21:01,010
You did a great service.

385
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,140
I'm flattered.

386
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,490
Great service? Nah.

387
00:21:03,830 --> 00:21:05,490
All for the East Sea.

388
00:21:07,680 --> 00:21:08,900
General, please lie down.

389
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:11,620
I'll do your final treatment.

390
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:12,700
Alright.

391
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:20,860
General.

392
00:21:22,030 --> 00:21:24,810
I thought of a name that suits you.

393
00:21:25,030 --> 00:21:25,900
How about

394
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:28,250
Mighty Whale?

395
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:29,250
Mighty Whale.

396
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:34,770
Love it. A mighty whale slays foes.

397
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:35,700
So badass.

398
00:21:36,110 --> 00:21:36,900
Lie back.

399
00:21:37,310 --> 00:21:38,090
Okay.

400
00:21:38,110 --> 00:21:40,380
That's not what I mean.

401
00:21:41,590 --> 00:21:42,730
When a whale falls,

402
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:45,090
all life thrives.

403
00:21:49,110 --> 00:21:50,460
Mortals suffer endless trials,

404
00:21:50,480 --> 00:21:52,250
tormenting themselves in pain.

405
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:53,330
General.

406
00:21:54,070 --> 00:21:55,090
From all suffering,

407
00:21:55,310 --> 00:21:56,860
I shall set you free.

408
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:51,620
I told him so many times

409
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:53,490
yet he never listens.

410
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:56,730
For the dragons,
no obstacles can remain.

411
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:59,010
Farewell, General Yecha.

412
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:02,010
I meant only to guide the tide,

413
00:23:02,830 --> 00:23:04,420
not stir waves from nothing.

414
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:08,220
This blood debt mars my Nine Cycles.

415
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:18,090
From here on,

416
00:23:19,830 --> 00:23:21,940
I'll leave it to you.

417
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:44,420
General Yecha.

418
00:23:44,440 --> 00:23:46,220
He is...

419
00:23:51,350 --> 00:23:52,140
Jinli.

420
00:23:53,790 --> 00:23:54,810
Repeat what you just said

421
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:57,290
one more time.

422
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:59,220
Yes.

423
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:01,490
At midnight,

424
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:04,180
Yecha drank with an Ascendance Sect man.

425
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,980
Soon, he fell into enemy hands

426
00:24:06,790 --> 00:24:07,700
and died on the spot.

427
00:24:07,750 --> 00:24:08,700
Is this truly so?

428
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:11,420
No. That cannot be.

429
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:14,250
Your Highness, Dragon Gate isn't open.

430
00:24:14,270 --> 00:24:16,380
Ascendance Sect can't flee the palace.

431
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:17,380
Do you mean

432
00:24:18,030 --> 00:24:19,660
I'm framing them?

433
00:24:23,960 --> 00:24:24,980
Master Jin Chan.

434
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:26,860
What's your verdict?

435
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:35,090
I've examined him.

436
00:24:37,030 --> 00:24:38,660
A deadly toxin was in the liquor.

437
00:24:39,030 --> 00:24:41,220
Human's Heart-Piercing Salve.

438
00:24:41,550 --> 00:24:43,180
His wounds

439
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:45,810
match the human spell used

440
00:24:46,240 --> 00:24:48,250
when we visited Ascendance Sect.

441
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:55,420
A human spell?

442
00:24:55,830 --> 00:24:58,420
Master Jin Chan, are you sure?

443
00:24:58,750 --> 00:25:01,090
After he returned last time,

444
00:25:01,960 --> 00:25:04,420
I treated his wounds.

445
00:25:04,750 --> 00:25:06,380
I am sure

446
00:25:07,750 --> 00:25:09,620
it was the same spell.

447
00:25:11,030 --> 00:25:11,900
So,

448
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:13,860
they knew General Yecha

449
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:15,420
couldn't be reached when sober.

450
00:25:16,790 --> 00:25:18,010
So they poisoned him first,

451
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:20,530
then attacked.

452
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:25,940
Your Highness.

453
00:25:26,310 --> 00:25:27,770
My condolences.

454
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:39,330
What?

455
00:25:40,830 --> 00:25:41,460
Your Highness.

456
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,420
My apologies.

457
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:44,090
I can't handle being lifted up.

458
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:45,530
My Yecha

459
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:47,330
is one of a kind.

460
00:25:55,440 --> 00:25:56,490
Luminous Pearl.

461
00:25:58,200 --> 00:26:00,010
This one's awesome.

462
00:26:00,030 --> 00:26:01,090
We have to take it.

463
00:26:01,790 --> 00:26:02,620
Look at them.

464
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,420
So clueless.

465
00:26:05,590 --> 00:26:08,420
His Majesty said, to quell the strife,

466
00:26:08,590 --> 00:26:11,220
these treasures are gifted to your sect.

467
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:12,980
We appreciate it.

468
00:26:15,310 --> 00:26:16,900
Wang Qi, can you carry all that?

469
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:17,620
All you do is grab.

470
00:26:18,590 --> 00:26:19,620
Aunt, here.

471
00:26:21,110 --> 00:26:22,330
Listen, in a bit,

472
00:26:22,350 --> 00:26:24,050
take this, this, this.

473
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:24,940
Take them all for me.

474
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:26,180
I'll grab them later.

475
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:26,980
Okay.

476
00:26:33,640 --> 00:26:34,420
Senior.

477
00:26:34,920 --> 00:26:35,980
Why so sleepy?

478
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:38,490
Look at that.

479
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,860
I was forced to drink. Up all night.

480
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:44,570
Where are the First Prince
and General Yecha?

481
00:26:46,030 --> 00:26:47,420
The First Prince being here is enough.

482
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:50,290
That Yecha's rude and ugly.

483
00:26:50,680 --> 00:26:51,570
Better without him.

484
00:26:53,310 --> 00:26:55,420
Neither of them is here.

485
00:26:56,240 --> 00:26:57,770
Feels off somehow.

486
00:26:58,960 --> 00:27:00,770
His Highness will open the Dragon Gate.

487
00:27:00,790 --> 00:27:03,220
Are all the envoys present?

488
00:27:06,310 --> 00:27:08,420
Only Uncle Kuai Si is missing.

489
00:27:08,550 --> 00:27:10,010
That Kuai Si.

490
00:27:10,110 --> 00:27:11,860
Usually so sharp. What's wrong today?

491
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:12,620
Oversleeping?

492
00:27:25,830 --> 00:27:27,380
Your sect is about to suffer.

493
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:29,770
You're completely unmoved?

494
00:27:31,350 --> 00:27:35,330
None of them are from Mistveil Division.

495
00:27:37,590 --> 00:27:38,330
Sir,

496
00:27:39,510 --> 00:27:40,770
what a cold heart.

497
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:44,730
That demon helped me survive
the Aureate Immortal Tribulation.

498
00:27:45,590 --> 00:27:47,900
I worked for your scheme in return.

499
00:27:48,400 --> 00:27:51,900
It's business. No heart involved.

500
00:27:55,350 --> 00:27:57,290
I dislike men like you.

501
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:03,380
Because I watch my sect get slaughtered?

502
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:06,530
No.

503
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:10,220
Because you're boring.

504
00:28:11,510 --> 00:28:12,900
Boring?

505
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:14,660
Can fun feed you?

506
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:18,330
Over there.

507
00:28:18,640 --> 00:28:20,730
They're more amusing.

508
00:28:24,200 --> 00:28:25,460
Nobody moves.

509
00:28:30,310 --> 00:28:32,010
Suspects from the Ascendance Sect.

510
00:28:32,030 --> 00:28:33,220
Take them all to the Eastern Palace.

511
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:34,980
For His Highness to interrogate.

512
00:28:35,440 --> 00:28:36,490
You seafood.

513
00:28:36,550 --> 00:28:37,980
How are we suspects?

514
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:39,250
Make it clear.

515
00:28:39,270 --> 00:28:42,010
General Yecha was poisoned by you.

516
00:28:42,240 --> 00:28:43,860
Proof is solid. Still denying it?

517
00:28:44,400 --> 00:28:45,530
General Yecha?

518
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:47,570
Nonsense.

519
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:49,220
Elder Kuai Si is coming.

520
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:51,420
We'll explain to the First Prince.

521
00:28:51,440 --> 00:28:52,700
You dare mention Kuai Si?

522
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:55,290
Room's empty. He fled.

523
00:28:56,310 --> 00:28:57,090
Fled?

524
00:28:58,550 --> 00:29:00,700
Human suspects refuse to confess.

525
00:29:01,030 --> 00:29:02,940
If we tolerate your arrogance,

526
00:29:03,030 --> 00:29:05,420
how can we face Yecha's soul?

527
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:07,090
All soldiers.

528
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:08,900
Arrest them all.

529
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:10,770
Kill those who resist.

530
00:29:10,790 --> 00:29:11,420
Yes.

531
00:29:13,000 --> 00:29:14,330
Senior disciples, engage.

532
00:29:14,790 --> 00:29:16,050
Junior disciples, fall back.

533
00:29:16,070 --> 00:29:16,770
Let's go.

534
00:29:18,350 --> 00:29:18,940
Attack.

535
00:29:29,510 --> 00:29:31,090
I persuaded Fairy Yunxiao to leave.

536
00:29:31,110 --> 00:29:33,010
The Mastermind, shamed into rage,

537
00:29:33,310 --> 00:29:35,250
framing us with this poison scheme.

538
00:29:35,750 --> 00:29:37,050
Senior, what do we do now?

539
00:29:37,550 --> 00:29:38,460
Now, the only way

540
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:40,050
is escaping the Dragon Palace.

541
00:29:40,440 --> 00:29:41,220
How?

542
00:29:45,720 --> 00:29:48,700
Dragon Palace has only one entrance.

543
00:29:48,720 --> 00:29:52,730
The water whirlwind is the Dragon Gate.

544
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:56,530
Only the Dragon Gate Token

545
00:29:56,720 --> 00:30:01,290
or royal dragon blood can open it.

546
00:30:01,440 --> 00:30:03,660
Dragon Gate Token or royal dragon blood.

547
00:30:03,830 --> 00:30:05,420
Junior, cover me.

548
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:06,090
All right.

549
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:10,730
Senior, what's your plan?

550
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:11,860
Sleep.

551
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:12,770
Sleep.

552
00:30:13,030 --> 00:30:13,810
Sleep?

553
00:30:14,070 --> 00:30:14,860
Senior.

554
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:35,770
Changshou.

555
00:30:36,830 --> 00:30:39,250
This Stellar Dreamweaver

556
00:30:39,720 --> 00:30:42,620
is worth 3,000 years of my work.

557
00:30:43,270 --> 00:30:44,730
Use it carefully.

558
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:46,220
Understood.

559
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:54,980
Speak.

560
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:02,490
Dragon Palace of the East Sea.

561
00:31:05,270 --> 00:31:06,570
Glitched a bit. No biggie.

562
00:31:06,590 --> 00:31:07,250
Speak.

563
00:31:08,270 --> 00:31:10,900
Ao Yi, Second Prince of the East Sea.

564
00:31:12,440 --> 00:31:13,530
His star's bright.

565
00:31:13,830 --> 00:31:15,420
Still asleep in dream.

566
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:19,220
All set. Go.

567
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:20,420
Okay.

568
00:31:24,070 --> 00:31:25,620
Is this thing safe?

569
00:31:26,350 --> 00:31:28,490
Barely. It's an antique.

570
00:31:28,790 --> 00:31:29,570
Okay.

571
00:31:43,380 --> 00:31:46,900
[My Future Self By Ao Yi Age 4]

572
00:31:52,980 --> 00:31:59,740
[Ao Yi's Dream]

573
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:13,460
Dragon Prince Ao Yi.

574
00:32:15,310 --> 00:32:17,810
I have urgent news.

575
00:32:17,830 --> 00:32:19,770
Super urgent. Wake up.

576
00:32:26,110 --> 00:32:27,620
Wake up. You're dying.

577
00:32:28,160 --> 00:32:29,460
My fate is my own.

578
00:32:32,070 --> 00:32:35,050
Never mock a poor youth.

579
00:32:35,510 --> 00:32:37,620
Almost forgot. He digs this stuff.

580
00:32:41,590 --> 00:32:42,860
Break through the darkness, young one.

581
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:46,330
What's going on?

582
00:32:46,920 --> 00:32:47,700
Where am I?

583
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:49,730
Who are you?

584
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:56,860
Young lady.

585
00:32:57,790 --> 00:32:59,290
Why bother?

586
00:33:00,070 --> 00:33:01,420
You have no magic.

587
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:03,180
How can you beat us?

588
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:09,900
Someone once asked me

589
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:13,420
why I draw my sword.

590
00:33:14,640 --> 00:33:16,140
Only at this moment

591
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:18,730
do I understand.

592
00:33:20,030 --> 00:33:21,730
It's to protect those behind me.

593
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:38,860
Senior Changshou.

594
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:40,900
I finally get it.

595
00:33:43,030 --> 00:33:43,940
Sir.

596
00:33:44,310 --> 00:33:45,460
Enlighten me again.

597
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:48,090
General Yecha is dead?

598
00:33:48,310 --> 00:33:51,620
The dragons now face a grand scheme.

599
00:33:51,640 --> 00:33:54,250
Human-dragon strife has long simmered

600
00:33:54,310 --> 00:33:56,220
and used by malicious schemers.

601
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:58,010
The fuse is about to be lit.

602
00:33:58,030 --> 00:34:00,420
War is about to break out.

603
00:34:01,030 --> 00:34:04,220
In this crisis, I can do nothing.

604
00:34:04,680 --> 00:34:05,860
Wrong.

605
00:34:06,310 --> 00:34:07,570
The way I see it,

606
00:34:07,790 --> 00:34:08,570
you are

607
00:34:08,590 --> 00:34:10,300
the dragon to break this deadlock.

608
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:11,010
Me?

609
00:34:11,590 --> 00:34:12,260
Really?

610
00:34:12,360 --> 00:34:13,690
Absolutely.

611
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:17,690
Your spirit roots are weak for now,

612
00:34:18,110 --> 00:34:20,210
but you bear the Dragon's Prophecy.

613
00:34:20,230 --> 00:34:22,170
You are the chosen one.

614
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:26,490
What should I do?

615
00:34:26,550 --> 00:34:27,610
Open the Dragon Gate.

616
00:34:28,710 --> 00:34:29,490
Dragon Gate?

617
00:34:30,360 --> 00:34:32,900
You want me to open the Dragon Gate

618
00:34:33,230 --> 00:34:35,460
to let humans escape this calamity?

619
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:36,260
Exactly.

620
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:39,610
I can't.

621
00:34:40,590 --> 00:34:41,380
What?

622
00:34:41,800 --> 00:34:43,610
I bear the prophecy,

623
00:34:45,150 --> 00:34:46,460
but I'm just a little dragon.

624
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:48,610
I never won in sparring.

625
00:34:48,630 --> 00:34:50,300
Even if my brother didn't...

626
00:34:51,510 --> 00:34:52,260
Why'd you smack me?

627
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:53,900
Scared of everything even in dreams.

628
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:56,740
Smacking me hurts in dreams too?

629
00:34:56,760 --> 00:34:57,980
Listen up.

630
00:34:58,150 --> 00:35:00,050
You're trapped by inner demons.

631
00:35:00,070 --> 00:35:01,090
Look at yourself.

632
00:35:01,110 --> 00:35:03,010
You're already a big dragon,

633
00:35:03,030 --> 00:35:04,900
yet timid and self-limiting.

634
00:35:05,920 --> 00:35:06,690
Look at me.

635
00:35:07,030 --> 00:35:08,340
Believe in yourself.

636
00:35:08,360 --> 00:35:09,900
You can do it.

637
00:35:10,030 --> 00:35:10,740
I...

638
00:35:11,360 --> 00:35:12,210
I can?

639
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:15,130
Yes, you can.

640
00:35:16,230 --> 00:35:17,090
I can do it.

641
00:35:17,230 --> 00:35:18,010
Exactly.

642
00:35:19,030 --> 00:35:20,050
The situation is urgent.

643
00:35:20,110 --> 00:35:23,170
Your brother's
hunting Ascendance disciples.

644
00:35:23,630 --> 00:35:25,650
No time to lose. Seize the chance.

645
00:35:25,670 --> 00:35:27,380
Beat your rivals to prove yourself.

646
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:28,090
Okay.

647
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:30,210
But have we met somewhere?

648
00:35:30,230 --> 00:35:31,380
You look so familiar.

649
00:35:34,230 --> 00:35:37,090
Senior, wake up.

650
00:35:38,780 --> 00:35:39,500
[Lotus Hall Treasure Catalog]

651
00:35:39,510 --> 00:35:40,300
This is the token.

652
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:41,420
Stick to the plan.

653
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:42,460
Just remember:

654
00:35:42,630 --> 00:35:43,610
Make it quick.

655
00:35:45,110 --> 00:35:46,050
Something over there?

656
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:56,380
Got it.

657
00:35:57,110 --> 00:35:58,340
Senior, wake up.

658
00:35:58,360 --> 00:35:59,210
We're in danger.

659
00:35:59,230 --> 00:36:00,210
Wake up.

660
00:36:00,230 --> 00:36:01,130
There. Found them.

661
00:36:02,230 --> 00:36:02,610
Hurry.

662
00:36:02,630 --> 00:36:03,380
Please.

663
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:04,650
Senior, wake up.

664
00:36:04,670 --> 00:36:06,050
Senior, it's urgent.

665
00:36:06,070 --> 00:36:06,650
What's going on?

666
00:36:07,760 --> 00:36:08,130
You...

667
00:36:10,840 --> 00:36:11,860
Let's do this.

668
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:17,610
Easy. Not the face.

669
00:36:35,840 --> 00:36:37,010
Over there.

670
00:36:37,030 --> 00:36:37,900
Not again.

671
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:44,090
Got it.

672
00:36:45,510 --> 00:36:46,380
Got it.

673
00:36:53,190 --> 00:36:53,900
Just a dream.

674
00:37:07,230 --> 00:37:08,340
No, it's not a dream.

675
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:32,530
Are you alright?

676
00:37:32,590 --> 00:37:33,210
I'm fine.

677
00:37:33,230 --> 00:37:34,420
Senior, you found a way out?

678
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:35,740
Sort of.

679
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:36,900
I'm heading out.

680
00:37:37,000 --> 00:37:38,210
Find a place to hide.

681
00:37:41,710 --> 00:37:42,820
Senior, I'm hidden.

682
00:37:50,510 --> 00:37:51,610
Are you looking for me?

683
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:54,740
Him. That's him.

684
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:56,860
He drank with General Yecha last night.

685
00:37:56,880 --> 00:37:57,820
You're right.

686
00:37:58,920 --> 00:37:59,340
Get him.

687
00:38:02,920 --> 00:38:04,420
Changshou, you're weak.

688
00:38:04,440 --> 00:38:05,610
You can't beat them.

689
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:10,740
Stop.

690
00:38:11,280 --> 00:38:11,940
It's Forbidden Land.

691
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:13,420
You can't enter, right?

692
00:38:13,660 --> 00:38:15,740
[Forbidden]

693
00:38:20,880 --> 00:38:23,460
You rat. Come out if you dare.

694
00:38:25,590 --> 00:38:27,210
Come in if you dare.

695
00:38:28,150 --> 00:38:30,130
You think it's safer, huh?

696
00:38:31,030 --> 00:38:32,690
[Forbidden]
This is Forbidden Land.

697
00:38:32,920 --> 00:38:35,340
Of course it's safer.

698
00:38:35,710 --> 00:38:36,820
Look behind you.

699
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:40,380
That's a trick for kids.

700
00:38:40,400 --> 00:38:41,940
You think I'll fall for that?

701
00:38:48,150 --> 00:38:50,170
So what if I look?

702
00:39:20,070 --> 00:39:21,380
You should wear more.

703
00:39:29,230 --> 00:39:30,130
That's not cool.

704
00:39:31,000 --> 00:39:33,340
Left without saying goodbye.

705
00:39:35,400 --> 00:39:36,490
But rest easy this time.

706
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:39,210
I won't kick your butt.

707
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:57,570
Father always said

708
00:40:00,030 --> 00:40:01,260
Forbidden Land

709
00:40:01,510 --> 00:40:04,260
is the most treacherous place.

710
00:40:04,960 --> 00:40:06,420
Only here

711
00:40:07,550 --> 00:40:09,130
deserves to bury General Yecha.

712
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:19,050
Over the ocean wide,

713
00:40:19,760 --> 00:40:20,940
you fought by my side.

714
00:40:21,920 --> 00:40:22,940
General Yecha.

715
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:25,820
Go in peace.

716
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:34,170
Go in peace.

717
00:40:35,110 --> 00:40:35,900
Farewell.

718
00:41:04,630 --> 00:41:05,820
Ao Jia, what are you doing?

719
00:41:07,230 --> 00:41:08,420
Just calm down.

720
00:41:10,190 --> 00:41:11,010
Why does everything I do

721
00:41:11,030 --> 00:41:12,300
seem so reckless to you?

722
00:41:12,710 --> 00:41:14,090
I'm completely sober.

723
00:41:14,550 --> 00:41:15,860
It's the Human Clan.

724
00:41:16,190 --> 00:41:18,690
Poisoning, killing, breaking our laws.

725
00:41:19,230 --> 00:41:20,980
My Yecha died for nothing.

726
00:41:21,150 --> 00:41:23,090
How can we not avenge this?

727
00:41:25,030 --> 00:41:26,420
I know what you'll say.

728
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:29,980
For one brief moment,

729
00:41:32,550 --> 00:41:33,820
I even thought

730
00:41:34,320 --> 00:41:35,380
of dropping this.

731
00:41:35,840 --> 00:41:36,650
Peace

732
00:41:37,150 --> 00:41:38,210
between humans and dragons?

733
00:41:38,710 --> 00:41:40,530
What happened to this so-called peace?

734
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:42,460
How did this "peace"

735
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:44,530
end up killing General Yecha?

736
00:41:45,510 --> 00:41:46,690
Human-Dragon peace

737
00:41:48,070 --> 00:41:49,940
is nothing but a lie!

738
00:41:50,360 --> 00:41:51,530
All forces, heed my command.

739
00:41:51,800 --> 00:41:52,420
Aye.

740
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:56,010
Kill any human on sight.

741
00:41:56,590 --> 00:41:59,490
We must stain the seas red.

742
00:42:00,230 --> 00:42:02,570
Only then can Yecha's soul rest.

743
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:05,530
Only then do we honor our past.

744
00:42:05,960 --> 00:42:07,210
You're not doing this for Yecha.

745
00:42:08,000 --> 00:42:09,980
You just want an excuse for war.

746
00:42:10,400 --> 00:42:11,210
Pearl Elites.

747
00:42:11,510 --> 00:42:11,940
Stand down.

748
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:12,740
Jiang Si'er.

749
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:16,820
You are my fiancée.

750
00:42:18,070 --> 00:42:19,210
Pearl Elites

751
00:42:19,960 --> 00:42:21,530
should answer to my command too.

752
00:42:21,550 --> 00:42:22,980
You call a retreat and that's it?

753
00:42:23,280 --> 00:42:24,210
Then mark my words.

754
00:42:25,510 --> 00:42:26,260
Right now,

755
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:28,780
I divorce you.

756
00:42:33,320 --> 00:42:34,740
What?

757
00:42:36,110 --> 00:42:37,340
We allied with dragons

758
00:42:38,030 --> 00:42:39,610
for peace.

759
00:42:40,070 --> 00:42:40,940
But now

760
00:42:41,880 --> 00:42:43,260
all I see is a lunatic

761
00:42:43,280 --> 00:42:44,860
killing innocents.

762
00:42:44,920 --> 00:42:46,420
My Mermaid Clan

763
00:42:46,880 --> 00:42:47,980
will have no part in this.

764
00:42:49,880 --> 00:42:50,530
Si'er.

765
00:42:51,760 --> 00:42:52,340
Si'er.

766
00:42:52,840 --> 00:42:53,260
Si'er.

767
00:42:54,400 --> 00:42:55,210
Jiang Si'er.

768
00:43:12,230 --> 00:43:13,420
What's so funny?

769
00:43:16,960 --> 00:43:19,820
You hypocritical butchers.

770
00:43:21,030 --> 00:43:23,690
General Yecha died an unjust death,

771
00:43:23,960 --> 00:43:25,570
yet you ignore the truth

772
00:43:25,590 --> 00:43:27,130
and frame humans for it.

773
00:43:27,150 --> 00:43:29,420
Isn't that ridiculous?

774
00:43:33,360 --> 00:43:33,820
Fine.

775
00:43:35,280 --> 00:43:35,570
Fine.

776
00:43:36,630 --> 00:43:38,650
Seems you care more about truth than me.

777
00:43:39,320 --> 00:43:40,210
Alright then.

778
00:43:42,590 --> 00:43:44,490
Why don't you go down and ask

779
00:43:44,510 --> 00:43:45,610
what the "truth" is?

780
00:43:46,840 --> 00:43:47,610
Now!

781
00:43:58,440 --> 00:44:00,300
The Primordial World

782
00:44:00,320 --> 00:44:02,940
faces a Great Tribulation.

783
00:44:03,760 --> 00:44:05,570
By then, heaven and earth
will be destroyed.

784
00:44:05,590 --> 00:44:07,460
Mountains of corpses
and seas of blood will arise.

785
00:44:08,320 --> 00:44:09,860
The Mortal Realm

786
00:44:09,880 --> 00:44:14,010
will turn to purgatory.

787
00:44:16,070 --> 00:44:17,740
So that's how it is.

788
00:44:57,490 --> 00:45:03,270
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

789
00:45:03,940 --> 00:45:10,640
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

790
00:45:12,170 --> 00:45:18,220
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

791
00:45:18,850 --> 00:45:25,300
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

792
00:45:26,040 --> 00:45:33,160
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

793
00:45:33,540 --> 00:45:40,440
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

794
00:45:40,820 --> 00:45:48,170
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

795
00:45:48,170 --> 00:45:55,340
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

796
00:46:11,480 --> 00:46:16,650
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

797
00:46:17,740 --> 00:46:24,760
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

798
00:46:25,950 --> 00:46:31,890
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

799
00:46:32,590 --> 00:46:39,670
♪Alas, our story is short♪

800
00:46:40,010 --> 00:46:47,120
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

801
00:46:47,440 --> 00:46:53,920
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

802
00:46:54,700 --> 00:47:01,910
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

803
00:47:02,300 --> 00:47:10,120
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
